# ============================================================
# USD/JPY LONG - PORTFOLIO REPLACEMENT SHOOTOUT
#
# READ-ONLY RESEARCH - NEVER SUBMITS ORDERS
#
# PURPOSE
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Compare a robust set of USD/JPY long replacement candidates
# directly inside the exact currently accepted 5-pair portfolio.
#
# Candidate pool includes:
#   - strongest robust rows by full-history total R
#   - strongest robust rows by last-5Y total R
#   - strongest robust rows by worst rolling 3Y PF
#   - Candidate B exactly
#
# This is portfolio-aware:
#   current accepted portfolio
#   - current USD_JPY BUY
#   + each candidate USD_JPY BUY trade stream
#
# PORTFOLIO COMPOUNDING
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# £100 starting balance
# 1% realised balance risk at ENTRY
# overlapping trades keep their entry risk fixed
# EXIT before ENTRY at identical timestamps
#
# LOCKED USD/JPY BACKTEST CONVENTIONS
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# OANDA midpoint H1
# exact bullish engulfing
# ATR14 Wilder/RMA SMA-seeded
# tick size .001
# reference entry signal close
# historical adverse fill close +5 ticks
# stop signal low -10 ticks
# RR 3.75
# target based on reference signal-close risk
# actual R uses adverse fill
# pyramiding 0
# exits begin next H1 candle
# exact exit-candle signal allowed
# same-bar long tie:
#   open->high closer => target first
#   otherwise stop first
#
# No EMA, weekday or session filters in these candidates.
# ============================================================


